  "features": [
    "Actual bounded inventory refresh requests tied to original enrollment generation, own human inventory authority and original MFA deadline",
    "Device-only single concurrent lease, at most three 45-second offers, explicit cancellation, expiry and connection replacement",
    "New hardware/security/compliance snapshots and sync completion commit atomically with exact retained transition evidence",
    "Rust 1.4 claims before actual collection and accepts only inventory.refresh; earlier request/response bodies remain compatible",
    "Own responsive UI with reason, exact versions, actual status, original history, read-only controls and source-loss clearing"
  ],
